<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="orks-main-0000-0001" name="LI - Orks" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="28d4-bd2e-4858-ece6" gameSystemRevision="130" type="catalogue">
  <readme>Orks (Xenos) faction for Horus Heresy 2.0. Based on Xenologica 2e - Waaaaagh! The Orks! (v2.2).

Faction: Xenos, Orks sub-faction

Alliance Levels:
- Sworn Brothers: None
- Fellow Warriors: None
- Distrusted Allies: Agents of the Warmaster, Legiones Astartes, Imperial Army, unlisted Xenos
- By the Emperor's Order: Agents of the Imperium, Mechanicum, Daemons of the Ruinstorm, T'au Empire, Leagues of Votann

Imperial Militia Provenance: Digganobz (Xenos faction, Fellow Warriors with Orks, Stubborn within 12" of Orks units)</readme>

